{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-11-12T21:09:08.534Z","author":"harness:claude-code","author_source":"detected","agent_harness":"claude-code","agent_model":"claude-opus-5-5","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"6cac702086723f6d9ab0b467","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"claude-opus-5-5","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"xhigh","source":"environment"},"role":{"value":"implementer","source":"argv"},"topic":null,"version":{"value":"2.1.322","source":"probe"}},"op":"create","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/id","value":"pm-gh1710"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/title","value":"GH-1710: budget compaction clips next_cursor to 240 characters, so --after rejects the cursor the page emitted and the rest of the result set is unreachable"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/description","value":"GH-1710 (filed 2026-11-12). When pm list compacts its output to fit an output budget, it shortens next_cursor like any other long string: the cursor is cut to 240 characters plus an ellipsis while the page still says has_more true, so --after rejects it with invalid_query_cursor and the rest of the result set is unreachable. Reproduced on main 145286488: eight items with 180-character ids and 2,000-character titles, pm list --json --output-budget 2000 --limit 4 (with or without --for triage) emits a 241-character cursor ending in an ellipsis instead of the 351-character one. Root cause: both string-compaction walkers, compactStrings in src/sdk/read-output-budget.ts and compactContextIntentValue in src/sdk/context-intent-contracts.ts, shorten every string longer than 240 characters, and the producer cursor is rebased only when rows are dropped, so a string-only compaction keeps the clipped value. Fix: a continuation token (key cursor or ending in _cursor) is never shortened in either walker, and a cursor argument carrying an ellipsis is refused with invalid_query_cursor reason cursor_compacted (read_output_cursor_invalid for --output-cursor) naming the larger-budget read that returns it whole."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/type","value":"Issue"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/status","value":"open"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/priority","value":1},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/tags","value":["agent-ux","gh:1710","output-budget","pagination","read-output"]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/created_at","value":"2026-11-12T21:09:08.534Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-11-12T21:09:08.534Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/author","value":"harness:claude-code"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/estimated_minutes","value":90},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/acceptance_criteria","value":"A budgeted list page emits next_cursor whole in JSON and TOON and with or without --for, and --after with it returns the next rows; Every continuation token in budgeted output (cursor, next_cursor, output_cursor, source_cursor) is exempt from string compaction; A cursor argument shortened by compaction is refused with invalid_query_cursor naming the larger-budget read that returns it whole"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/parent","value":"pm-5t33or"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/risk","value":"medium"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/confidence","value":"high"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/severity","value":"high"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/expected_result","value":"next_cursor is never compacted and resumes the query"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/actual_result","value":"next_cursor is clipped to 240 characters and --after exits 2 invalid_query_cursor"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/dependencies","value":[{"id":"pm-n98pir","kind":"related","created_at":"2026-11-12T21:09:08.534Z","author":"harness:claude-code","source_kind":"cli:create:dep","author_source":"detected"}]}],"before_hash":"3cc22dff72be7b14824654a7a64ea62b04799939b2fee54c1b5f52ca60bf6df0","after_hash":"05f116e1bbe7bee5cfff2a763b36418903e62b2991cbd4cecb4935ac5add7e9f","item_hash_version":3,"message":"","context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"}}},"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"f6e2e267c5403807c721d40b51ae7343e94ccba11a94ae9bb8dc3dfae1fcfa2a"}
