{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-11-12T21:55:15.824Z","author":"harness:claude-code","author_source":"detected","agent_harness":"claude-code","agent_model":"claude-opus-5-5","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"6cac702086723f6d9ab0b467","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"claude-opus-5-5","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"xhigh","source":"environment"},"role":{"value":"implementer","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-gh1710","claim:pm-n98pir","lineage:pm-n98pir","lineage:pm-mpbb","lineage:pm-doxj"]},"topic":{"value":"workset:pm-gh1710+pm-n98pir","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-gh1710","claim:pm-n98pir","lineage:pm-n98pir","lineage:pm-mpbb","lineage:pm-doxj"]},"version":{"value":"2.1.322","source":"probe"}},"op":"note_add","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-11-12T21:55:15.824Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/notes","value":[{"created_at":"2026-11-12T21:55:15.824Z","author":"harness:claude-code","text":"Implementation (2026-11-12). Both string-compaction walkers (compactStrings in src/sdk/read-output-budget.ts and compactContextIntentValue in src/sdk/context-intent-contracts.ts) now skip any string under a continuation-token key, decided by isContinuationTokenKey in src/core/shared/text-normalization.ts: the key cursor or any key ending in _cursor (next_cursor, output_cursor, source_cursor, base_source_cursor). A non-string value under such a key is still walked, so explanatory text nested under a cursor object keeps compacting. The cursor decoders refuse an argument carrying an ellipsis before parsing: decodeQueryCursorEnvelope (--after and --cursor) with invalid_query_cursor and reason cursor_compacted, decodeReadOutputContinuationCursor (--output-cursor) with read_output_cursor_invalid and the same reason; both name the larger-budget read that returns the whole cursor. Cursor lengths stay bounded by MAX_CURSOR_LENGTH, so exempting them cannot defeat the budget. Verified on the built CLI with the issue reproduction: page 1 emits the whole 351-character cursor and page 2 returns the next four items, with and without --for triage."}]}],"before_hash":"d1c2f438e9488fdfcc4f9bc48ca3361fd4a22115945fd56620822ad894b219ea","after_hash":"7328cb72326f73ceb34a4907da8f9be51cb4b1dfaed5a8d53b615a179373c48d","item_hash_version":3,"context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"}}},"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"8e3cc3b65c3504b02d276857a5870cf1998fbe50a233317df2f80df849448883"}
